createLesson()

Purpose:
Existing module ke andar ek naya lesson create karta hai.

Process:

req.body se moduleId, title, content, order aur duration receive karta hai.
Required fields validate karta hai.
Lesson.create() ke through lesson MongoDB mein save karta hai.
201 response return karta hai.
Error hone par 500 response return karta hai.

Endpoint:

POST /api/lessons

Request Body:

{
  "moduleId": "MODULE_ID",
  "title": "What is a Qubit?",
  "content": "A qubit is the basic unit of quantum information.",
  "order": 1,
  "duration": 10
}
getLessonsByModule()

Purpose:
Kisi particular module ke saare lessons retrieve karta hai.

Process:

URL ke moduleId parameter ko receive karta hai.
Lesson.find({ moduleId }) se us module ke lessons find karta hai.
sort({ order: 1 }) se lessons ko sequence ke according arrange karta hai.
Lessons ko response mein return karta hai.

Endpoint:

GET /api/modules/:moduleId/lessons

Input:
URL mein Module ki _id.

Example:

GET /api/modules/68b1a2c3d4e5f67890123456/lessons

Output:
Us particular module ke saare lessons.